{"src":"en","tgt":"ro","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":164500,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"ro","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":6133.46951,"text":"But after losing the captain's wicket, India only made 36 runs, losing seven was a big"},{"kind":"text","t":6492.108484,"text":"Dar după ce a pierdut wicket-ul căpitanului, India a făcut doar 36 de puncte, pierzând șapte a fost o mare pierdere."},{"kind":"audio","t":6655.618708999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6657.533998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6658.587409000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6659.700291,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6661.364885,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":6662.741932,"samples":27306,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":980},{"kind":"input","t":12759.659178,"text":"They usually have special food, drink, and entertainment offers to keep guests in a good mood and to keep them at the premise."},{"kind":"text","t":13209.032935,"text":"De obicei, au oferte speciale de mâncare, băutură și divertisment pentru a menține oaspeții într-o dispoziție bună și pentru a le menține la premisă."},{"kind":"audio","t":13376.224094,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13377.408188,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13379.087522,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13380.770165,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13382.48165,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13384.137863,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13385.172874,"samples":22681,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":790},{"kind":"input","t":19246.254821000002,"text":"Del Potro has the early advantage in the second set, but this is too required a tie break after"},{"kind":"text","t":19501.451878,"text":"Del Potro are avantajul timpuriu în al doilea set, dar acest lucru este prea necesar un tie break după"},{"kind":"audio","t":19618.04878,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19619.324416,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19620.986109,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19622.630972000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19623.845867,"samples":26080,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1030},{"kind":"input","t":25305.54639,"text":"The internet combines elements of both mass and interpersonal communication."},{"kind":"text","t":25487.595177,"text":"Internetul combină elemente de comunicare în masă și interpersonală."},{"kind":"audio","t":25571.765168,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25573.043904000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25574.830420000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25575.002043,"samples":5628,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":90},{"kind":"input","t":34429.16643,"text":"The composition of these crystals matches those found in urine of affected pets when compared by infrared spectroscopy."},{"kind":"text","t":34820.530161999995,"text":"Compoziția acestor cristale se potrivește cu cele găsite în urina animalelor de companie afectate atunci când sunt comparate prin spectroscopie în infraroșu."},{"kind":"audio","t":34986.108028999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34987.563158,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34989.191120999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34990.782583,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34992.457125999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34994.053238,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34995.674010999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":34995.807393999996,"samples":780,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":36876.630439,"text":"F-T-I-R."},{"kind":"text","t":36983.577707,"text":"F-T-I-R."},{"kind":"audio","t":37005.800233999995,"samples":18111,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":560},{"kind":"input","t":42295.201316,"text":"on some routes the larger companies have their own planes but for other routes and smaller firms there was a"},{"kind":"text","t":42567.376584,"text":"Pe unele rute, companiile mai mari au propriile avioane, dar pentru alte rute și firme mai mici a existat o"},{"kind":"audio","t":42700.957397,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42702.468217999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42704.109111,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42705.712043,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42707.224393,"samples":30260,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"input","t":49520.01971,"text":"Some atoms have unstable nuclei, which means that they tend to break up"},{"kind":"text","t":49792.128206999994,"text":"Unii atomi au nuclee instabile, ceea ce înseamnă că au tendința de a se rupe"},{"kind":"audio","t":49883.693646,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":49885.010273,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":49886.627725,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":49886.795868999994,"samples":7578,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":220},{"kind":"input","t":53496.363714,"text":"and break apart with little or no nudging."},{"kind":"text","t":53667.301396999996,"text":"şi se despart cu puţină sau nici o împingere."},{"kind":"audio","t":53725.245661999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53726.757212,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":53726.885255,"samples":1616,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":60649.495666999996,"text":"The same month saw another airliner overrun a runway at Moshland and strike a wall killing 17."},{"kind":"text","t":61031.88725,"text":"În aceeași lună, un alt avion de linie a depășit o pistă la Moshland și a lovit un perete, omorând 17 persoane."},{"kind":"audio","t":61172.402312,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61173.648038,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61175.313560999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61176.952004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61178.593807,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61179.331051999994,"samples":17554,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":620},{"kind":"input","t":67223.359584,"text":"They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":67540.92330400001,"text":"Acestea sunt aproape toate plaje de nisip cu înot în condiții de siguranță și cele mai multe au umbra oferite de copaci."},{"kind":"audio","t":67668.15504,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67669.669251,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67671.327294,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67672.96913700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67674.61553000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":67674.708192,"samples":2507,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":70278.013922,"text":"Pohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":70348.46162700001,"text":"Copaci Pohican."},{"kind":"audio","t":70377.869498,"samples":28699,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1010},{"kind":"input","t":76434.55178400001,"text":"Popular sports include football, basketball, volleyball, water polo, fencing, rugby,"},{"kind":"text","t":76734.02356,"text":"Sporturile populare includ fotbal, baschet, volei, polo pe apă, scrimă, rugby,"},{"kind":"audio","t":76837.67040300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76839.238264,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76840.806226,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76842.411208,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76842.633822,"samples":9083,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":200},{"kind":"input","t":80704.11840800001,"text":"cycling, ice hockey, roller hockey, and F1."},{"kind":"text","t":80902.44185300001,"text":"Ciclism, hochei pe gheaţă, hochei pe role şi F1."},{"kind":"audio","t":80970.573331,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80971.868697,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80972.57864200001,"samples":17498,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":620},{"kind":"input","t":86516.58227900001,"text":"In the warm climate of the Middle East, the house was not so important."},{"kind":"text","t":86715.215379,"text":"În climatul cald al Orientului Mijlociu, casa nu era atât de importantă."},{"kind":"audio","t":86804.48406300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":86805.983443,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":86807.559534,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":86807.76689900001,"samples":8693,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":260},{"kind":"input","t":93197.27938200001,"text":"The lake lies 120 kilometers north of Peninsula."},{"kind":"text","t":93368.13530400001,"text":"Lacul se află la 120 de kilometri nord de Peninsula."},{"kind":"audio","t":93450.88354600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":93452.21330300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":93453.84794600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":93453.989769,"samples":3956,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":98328.139909,"text":"The cabbage juice changes color depending on how acidic, basic, alkaline the chemical is."},{"kind":"text","t":98655.02169600001,"text":"Sucul de varză își schimbă culoarea în funcție de cât de acidă, bazică, alcalină este substanța chimică."},{"kind":"audio","t":98778.588118,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":98779.98839700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98781.58141900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98783.19340100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98784.829784,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":98784.992707,"samples":3064,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":105753.446821,"text":"The bridge is scheduled to be fully operational in September 2017 when the Brazilian custom checkpoints are expected to be finished."},{"kind":"text","t":106145.674761,"text":"Podul este programat să fie pe deplin operațional în septembrie 2017, când se așteaptă ca punctele de control vamal braziliene să fie finalizate."},{"kind":"audio","t":106330.116366,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106331.459973,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106333.226659,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106335.132157,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":106336.553365,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106338.162758,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106339.83877100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106340.540515,"samples":16941,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":520},{"kind":"input","t":113151.196899,"text":"The moisture on your hands will react with the outer layers, which will feel funny and form a sort of shell."},{"kind":"text","t":113486.05483600001,"text":"Umezeala de pe mâini va reacționa cu straturile exterioare, care se vor simți amuzante și vor forma un fel de coajă."},{"kind":"audio","t":113617.41416500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113618.856364,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113620.46948700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113622.14175000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113623.766363,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113624.250153,"samples":11981,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":340},{"kind":"input","t":119601.7973,"text":"One bomb exploded outside the Governor's General's office."},{"kind":"text","t":119763.849355,"text":"O bombă a explodat în fața biroului guvernatorului general."},{"kind":"audio","t":119842.41436400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119843.764461,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119845.19721900001,"samples":30037,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"input","t":125311.23752000001,"text":"The Moroccan Sultan rebuilt the city as Daru i Bayt"},{"kind":"text","t":125491.29954800001,"text":"Sultanul marocan a reconstruit orașul ca Daru i Bayt"},{"kind":"audio","t":125562.19621200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":125563.650571,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":125564.482858,"samples":19170,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":590},{"kind":"input","t":130429.477314,"text":"and it was given the name Casablanca by Spanish traders who established trading bases."},{"kind":"text","t":130701.45035800002,"text":"Numele Casablanca i-a fost dat de către comercianții spanioli care au înființat aici baze comerciale."},{"kind":"audio","t":130814.94707800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130816.319045,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130817.95239800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130819.71833400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130820.28778500001,"samples":14934,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":142848.58000999998,"text":"He was greeted by Singapore's Deputy Prime Minister Wong Kan-seng and discussed trade and terrorism issues with the Singapore Prime Minister Lee Hsien Long."},{"kind":"text","t":143232.110525,"text":"El a fost întâmpinat de vicepremierul Wong Kan-seng și a discutat despre comerț și terorism cu prim-ministrul Lee Hsien Long."},{"kind":"audio","t":143374.613448,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143376.138978,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143377.782491,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143379.427834,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143381.083238,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143382.48898599998,"samples":28421,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1030},{"kind":"input","t":154267.029743,"text":"The fission bomb works on the principle that it takes energy to put together a nucleus with many protons and neutrons."},{"kind":"text","t":154594.314208,"text":"Bomba de fisiune funcționează pe principiul că este nevoie de energie pentru a pune împreună un nucleu cu mulți protoni și neutroni."},{"kind":"audio","t":154754.077168,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154755.50947699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154757.191361,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154758.87309399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154760.58385899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154762.308403,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":154762.436926,"samples":1225,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":162827.110063,"text":"In the archipelago and lakes you do not necessarily need a yacht"},{"kind":"text","t":163034.783435,"text":"În arhipelag și pe lacuri nu aveți neapărat nevoie de un iaht"},{"kind":"audio","t":163112.264561,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163113.832953,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163115.072468,"samples":26414,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"close","t":174606.437405,"code":1005}]}